'''Growing Catfruit''' (進化のマタタビ, ''Shinka no Matatabi'', '''Evolution Actinidia''') is the permanent [[Catfruit]] gathering event. By clearing any of these stages, you might get 1~3 Catfruit, three Seeds or an Epic Catfruit. You also have a small chance to unlock and play the special stage Catfruit Jubilee. This event was added in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]], replacing [[Growing Green]], [[Growing Purple]], [[Growing Red]], [[Growing Blue]] and [[Growing Yellow]].

