==Trivia==
*Growing Catfruit, [[Bahamut Cat's Trial]], [[Unleashing the Cats]], and [[Valkyrie Cat's Trial]] are the only event stages to have no time limit.
**Growing Catfruit is the only one of these stages that doesn't disappear on clear.

